{"id":"c872cbd044394959","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Expected Payoff","display":"df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff — ZFC Game3 Expected Payoff","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff — ZFC Game3 Expected Payoff","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff — ZFC Game3 Expected Payoff"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25befa5da8a672e6\" href=\"?note=25befa5da8a672e6\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree\">58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,H,Z,u,\\mu,i,e,z,h\\in V\">\\(N,H,Z,u,\\mu,i,e,z,h\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25befa5da8a672e6\" href=\"?note=25befa5da8a672e6\" title=\"58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree\">58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExpectedPayoff}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExpectedPayoff}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}expected\\text{-}payoff} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExpectedPayoff}_S(N,H,u,\\mu,i,e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S(H)\n\\land i\\in N\n\\land\\exists Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nZ=\\{z\\in H:\\neg\\exists h\\in H\\;(z\\subsetneq h)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,N\\times Z,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,Z,[0,1])\n\\land\\sum_{z\\in Z}\\mu(z)=1\n\\land\\sum_{z\\in Z}|u(i,z)|\\mu(z)&lt;\\infty\n\\land e\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land e=\\sum_{z\\in Z}u(i,z)\\mu(z)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}expected\\text{-}payoff} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExpectedPayoff}_S(N,H,u,\\mu,i,e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S(H)\n\\land i\\in N\n\\land\\exists Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nZ=\\{z\\in H:\\neg\\exists h\\in H\\;(z\\subsetneq h)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,N\\times Z,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,Z,[0,1])\n\\land\\sum_{z\\in Z}\\mu(z)=1\n\\land\\sum_{z\\in Z}|u(i,z)|\\mu(z)&lt;\\infty\n\\land e\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land e=\\sum_{z\\in Z}u(i,z)\\mu(z)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The terminal histories are taken from a declared extensive game tree, and the\nabsolute-integrability clause makes the expected payoff well-defined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree","status":"resolved","id":"25befa5da8a672e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree","status":"resolved","id":"25befa5da8a672e6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-game4-extensive-game-tree]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,H,Z,u,\\mu,i,e,z,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExpectedPayoff}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}expected\\text{-}payoff} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame3ExpectedPayoff}_S(N,H,u,\\mu,i,e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ExtensiveGameTree}_S(H)\n\\land i\\in N\n\\land\\exists Z\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nZ=\\{z\\in H:\\neg\\exists h\\in H\\;(z\\subsetneq h)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,N\\times Z,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,Z,[0,1])\n\\land\\sum_{z\\in Z}\\mu(z)=1\n\\land\\sum_{z\\in Z}|u(i,z)|\\mu(z)<\\infty\n\\land e\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land e=\\sum_{z\\in Z}u(i,z)\\mu(z)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1368,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff.md|58-df-zfc-game3-expected-payoff]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","25befa5da8a672e6","36d7463d215be751"]}